@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+---
+id: task-003-apply-10-discount-to-rentals-of-3-days-or-more
+type: task
+title: "Apply 10% discount to rentals of 3 days or more"
+status: approved
+---
+
+## Request
+
+A rental of 3 days or more now costs 10% less than its full price. Both `quote()` and `book()` must show
+the reduced total.
+
+## What was done
+
+- Added failing tests first (red) in `src/index.test.ts`: no discount under 3 days, a 10% discount at
+  exactly 3 days, a 10% discount above 3 days with a fractional-cent result rounded to the nearest cent,
+  and `book()` storing the discounted total. Updated the two pre-existing tests that quoted/booked a
+  3-day rental, since their expected totals were full price and are now stale given the new rule.
+- Implemented a `priceFor(days, dailyPrice)` helper in `src/index.ts` (green): full price below
+  `LONG_RENTAL_DAYS` (3), otherwise full price times `(1 - LONG_RENTAL_DISCOUNT)` (10%) rounded with
+  `Math.round` to the nearest cent. `quote()` now calls `priceFor` instead of computing `days *
+  dailyPrice` directly; `book()` already reuses `quote()` for its total, so it inherits the discount with
+  no change of its own.
+- Updated the `Quote` and `Booking` doc comments to mention the discount.
+- All 20 tests pass (`node --test`); no new dependency was added.
